# Arqit device credentials (REALM_PASSWORD, Q_KEY) — must never land in a
# build layer, same pattern as .gitignore. A bare COPY . . in the Dockerfile
# would otherwise freeze these into an intermediate image layer even though
# the runtime stage never reads them from there.
**/aq-*.json
